          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"generated-counterterms\">Generated counterterms</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Expand the bare factors <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_\\phi||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_\\phi Z_m||)</marimo-tex>, and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_g Z_\\phi^2||)</marimo-tex> in the kinetic, mass, and quartic operators. Keep the one-loop field constant symbolic while generating the three one-loop insertions. The two-point rules at second order supply the final linear system.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Parametric IBP derives the doubled-tadpole recurrence. Then insert <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(z_\\phi^{(1)}=0||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(z_g^{(1)}=3/(2\\epsilon)||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(z_m^{(1)}=1/(2\\epsilon)||)</marimo-tex>, in units of <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(g/(16\\pi^2)||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "BYtC",
