      "id": "RGSE",
      "code_hash": "0b261b8f66792772859c1ed17fa53c77",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"solve-the-generated-counterterm-system\">Solve the generated counterterm system</h2></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">[[1, 0],\n [-1, -1]]</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>One-loop counterterm poles</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">3/4\u00b7M/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>M\u00b7Lm/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>M\u00b7L4pi/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>M/eps\u00b2</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Sum before local subtraction</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-1/4\u00b7M/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/2\u00b7M/eps\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/24\u00b7p2/eps</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Field renormalization</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>1/6144\u00b7g\u00b2/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 0, 205)\">\ud835\udf0b</span>\u2074\u00b7eps<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Mass-squared renormalization</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/32\u00b7g/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 0, 205)\">\ud835\udf0b</span>\u00b2\u00b7eps<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>5/6144\u00b7g\u00b2/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 0, 205)\">\ud835\udf0b</span>\u2074\u00b7eps<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/512\u00b7g\u00b2/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 0, 205)\">\ud835\udf0b</span>\u2074\u00b7eps\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">With <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(a=g/(16\\pi^2)||)</marimo-tex> these are <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_\\phi=1-a^2/(24\\epsilon)||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z_m=1+a/(2\\epsilon)+a^2[1/(2\\epsilon^2)-5/(24\\epsilon)]||)</marimo-tex>. The generated local counterterms cancel every pole exactly.</span></span></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
